{"lines":[{"c":1,"h":0.016646532471993325,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.070020444698213655,"y":0.044729059331184873,"w":0.12593849182128908},{"x":0.065979373734990923,"y":0.093023255980996589,"h":0.015988371754420583,"w":0.74845362345377597,"c":1,"t":"The sculpture gallery has a number of fine exhibits, but I'm afraid it's currently closed for"},{"w":0.7587628682454427,"h":0.01614797416324143,"c":1,"x":0.063917534843629845,"t":"refurbishment. You'll need to come back next year to see it properly, but a number of the..","y":0.10892542554767315},{"c":1,"x":0.86804123783534448,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"Q13","y":0.10901162780552365,"w":0.039175256093343047},{"x":0.065979377924010499,"c":1,"w":0.50103093465169268,"t":"sculptures have been moved to other parts of the museum.","h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.12499999993034194},{"w":0.7958762613932292,"t":"'Around the world' is a temporary exhibition - you've probably seen something about it on TV","h":0.015990932059162022,"c":1,"y":0.14679976528607153,"x":0.063917534375550436},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.1655901349494161,"w":0.76907216389973954,"t":"or in the newspapers. It's created a great deal of interest, because it presents objects from","x":0.063917526197555974,"c":1},{"x":0.063836281731409955,"w":0.76097925821940104,"h":0.018234431568622922,"c":1,"y":0.17927838262553231,"t":"every continent and many countries, and provides information about their social context -"},{"t":"why they were made, who for, and so on.","w":0.35257731119791669,"x":0.063917529857353994,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"y":0.19759248397570506},{"c":1,"x":0.063917513607429866,"t":"Then there's the collection of coins. This is what you might call a focused, specialist","w":0.71134023030598947,"y":0.22078684681658101,"h":0.017615971814445075},{"x":0.06597937150209722,"y":0.23691860469207482,"w":0.75670104980468755,"t":"collection, because all the coins come from this country, and were produced between two","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"h":0.018437195720213406,"c":1,"w":0.84551035563151034,"t":"thousand and a thousand years ago. And many otthem were discovered by ordinary people. Q15","x":0.06385373066411755,"y":0.25279707657648098},{"h":0.016121055123670236,"w":0.43730662027994793,"y":0.26931351369047707,"t":"digging their gardens, and donated to the museum!","c":1,"x":0.063818656538605106},{"t":"All our porcelain and glass was left to the museum by its founder, when he died in 1878. And Q16","y":0.29359953015709928,"h":0.015993492923900066,"c":1,"x":0.063917528461813519,"w":0.84536081949869801},{"x":0.0659793782061531,"w":0.78556701660156247,"c":1,"t":"in the terms of his will, we're not allowed to add anything to that collection: he believed it was","h":0.013211978860833806,"y":0.31092190278328902},{"t":"perfect in itself, and we don't see any reason to disagree!","h":0.015988371754420583,"x":0.063917537745255396,"y":0.3270348838863697,"w":0.48865976969401043,"c":1},{"x":0.068041237571060745,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"OK, that was something about the collections, and now here's some more practical","w":0.70103093465169275,"y":0.37345860266222219},{"w":0.71546391805013021,"x":0.061855669695754803,"y":0.38953488388563717,"t":"information, in case you need it. Most of the museum facilities are downstairs, in the","h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1},{"x":0.065979376914835755,"t":"basement, so you go down the stairs here. When you reach the bottom of the stairs, you'll","y":0.40692894896343845,"w":0.76288660685221354,"h":0.013211978860833917,"c":1},{"w":0.76494847615559891,"h":0.01453488361674482,"x":0.065979370066530499,"y":0.42296511632920353,"c":1,"t":"find yourself in a sitting area, with comfortable chairs and sofas where you can have a rest"},{"c":1,"x":0.065979380801260562,"y":0.4389312978730544,"t":"before continuing your exploration of the museum.","w":0.43092783610026042,"h":0.013211978860833806},{"t":"We have a very good restaurant, which serves excellent food all day, in a relaxing","c":1,"x":0.065935750156022641,"y":0.46194834561720821,"w":0.69082204182942708,"h":0.017692490878415956},{"t":"atmosphere. Io reach it, when you get to the bottom of the stairs, go straight ahead to the far.","h":0.016437560197401169,"y":0.47798189613378206,"c":1,"w":0.79596989949544272,"x":0.063867649429069501},{"c":1,"x":0.063917546479237045,"h":0.014679976512037674,"y":0.49412800948425328,"t":"side of the sitting area, then tum right into the corridor. You'll see the door of the restaurant","w":0.77113398234049479},{"h":0.013226124376531034,"x":0.061606324757464158,"t":"facing you.","c":1,"y":0.51230043154690497,"w":0.095289866129557282},{"t":"If you just want a snack, or if you'd like to eat somewhere with facilities for children, we also","x":0.063917531217975637,"y":0.53488372109523585,"w":0.77525772094726564,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1},{"t":"have a cafe. When you reach the bottom of the stairs, you'll need to go straight ahead, tum","y":0.55066382714317585,"w":0.77535273234049484,"x":0.061801439921366448,"h":0.016453385703086298,"c":1},{"w":0.52590794881184899,"c":1,"y":0.56689029776288025,"h":0.016024015541995063,"x":0.061788566968990516,"t":"right into the corridor, and the café is immediately on the right."},{"c":1,"t":"And talking about children, there are baby-changing facilities downstairs: cross the sitting","y":0.59018347523062686,"h":0.018201936642282202,"w":0.75480611165364586,"x":0.061770172865772584},{"y":0.60745742810191838,"t":"area, continue straight ahead along the corridor on the left, and you and your baby will find","w":0.76907216389973954,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.06185567069841947,"c":1},{"t":"the facilities on the left-hand Side.","w":0.28687169392903644,"c":1,"x":0.06173159860298625,"h":0.017048130718596344,"y":0.62254131017450198},{"t":"Ihe cloakroom, where you should leave coats, umbrellas and any large bags, is on the leff","c":1,"x":0.061789991110676588,"y":0.6467702816318468,"h":0.016549416170775433,"w":0.76920608520507805},{"x":0.061808256436820176,"y":0.66279489691574389,"t":"hand side of the sitting area, It's through the last door before you come to the corridor.","w":0.72999755859374993,"h":0.016009220990165884,"c":1},{"y":0.68750000000941747,"x":0.061855685984391846,"h":0.015988371754420694,"w":0.77113398234049479,"t":"There are toilets on every floor, but in the basement they're the first rooms on the lefl when","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.17363052368164061,"t":"you get down there.","x":0.059533553872686822,"y":0.70368748484782806,"h":0.016379504783392895},{"t":"OK, now if you've got anything to leave in the cloakroom, please do that now, and then we'll","w":0.77938145955403648,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"x":0.061855661872191374,"y":0.72812683500795539},{"y":0.74444931233093348,"h":0.014445966786660658,"c":1,"x":0.059546998987218228,"w":0.11813069661458332,"t":"start our tour."},{"t":"Q17","y":0.47819767422267478,"w":0.041237112681070998,"c":1,"x":0.868041237638846,"h":0.013081395479069058},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.86804123782388976,"y":0.55087209292180273,"t":"Q18","w":0.039175256093343047},{"c":1,"t":"Q19","y":0.59156976733826994,"w":0.039175256093343158,"x":0.86804123782961706,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"h":0.011627907341393184,"t":"Q20","w":0.041237112681070998,"c":1,"x":0.86597938170070166,"y":0.6482558137388641},{"x":0.061855671900794204,"w":0.16288659413655598,"y":0.80377906981009639,"t":"SECTION 3","c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"w":0.73823262532552081,"t":"supERvisor: Hi, Joanna, good to meet you. Now, before we discuss your new research","y":0.83256694169856615,"x":0.061808770626940089,"c":1,"h":0.016255617841719361},{"t":"project, I'd like to hear something about the psychology study you did last year","y":0.85026423956157926,"w":0.67010309855143235,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"x":0.17113401763261285},{"c":1,"y":0.86627906981708769,"x":0.16907216117486182,"w":0.61649485270182292,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"for your Master's degree. So how did you choose your subjects for that?"},{"c":1,"w":0.061855672200520836,"x":0.061855668947467732,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.88372093035966326,"t":"JOANNA:"},{"x":0.17113401263631459,"h":0.015989225189334433,"t":"Well, I had six subjects, all professional musicians, and all female. Three were","y":0.88226658859203777,"w":0.66391754150390625,"c":1},{"w":0.67835052490234382,"x":0.17113401579189941,"c":1,"y":0.89812096288689103,"h":0.014679976512037674,"t":"violinists and there was also a cello player and a pianist and a flute player. They"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"were all very highly regarded in the music world and they'd done quite extensiye. Q21 & 22","w":0.77938145955403648,"y":0.91424418609634028,"x":0.16907215673613327,"c":1},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"y":0.93012331179992724,"w":0.65979380289713541,"t":"tours in different continents, and quite a few had won prizes and competitions","x":0.16907217062351851},{"c":1,"t":"120","w":0.037113402684529624,"x":0.059793814012495651,"y":0.95348837210236626,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"h":0.015701347144995492,"t":"as wel.","x":0.16883022832673689,"w":0.06852511088053384,"c":1,"y":0.9456376981238741},{"w":0.29164334615071619,"y":0.95332793375168801,"x":0.35211542739953283,"h":0.023641737502809845,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"h":3406,"w":2400}